{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Strange incense.</b> Any incense that does not come from public funds — even if it comes from a priest's own — is called strange incense, just as Nadav and Avihu did when each took his own firepan, and for this they were punished. Another interpretation: <b>strange incense</b> — that is not according to its formula."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:11.537568917Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}